  "prefLabel": "Site 102.32 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.32 “Person” means “person” as defined by RSA 162-H:2, IX, namely, “any individual, group, firm, partnership, corporation, cooperative, municipality, political subdivision, government agency or other organization.”\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15 (from Site 102.12)",
